    "updated_at": "2022-03-02T00:23:55Z",
    "body": "You were faster than me :-) \r\nI was still fiddling with the defaults that I changed from mp2 to zero-guess (but had to make things consistent, so that zero-guess would not lead to the elimination of all operators later). It should work now.\r\n\r\nFYI:\r\nMP2 pre-screening for UCCSD is now deactivated by default.\r\nif you want to use MP2-Prescreening call it like this: make_ansatz(name=\"UCCSD\", initial_amplitudes=\"mp2\")",
